    },
    {
      "item_id": "expectation_a837fbf4e947a837d28a55567856c4c77be0f78b9303d2f28183dad164970039",
      "item_type": "expectation",
      "source_text": "On March 13, 2014, Mallinckrodt Manager of Compliance, Debbie LaVelle (Debbie.lavelle@mallinckrodt.com) disseminated new, specific guidelines for health care provider meals: breakfast/lunch/snack/coffee should not be brought into a provider's office more than once a week, and should not be brought in on two consecutive sales calls to the same office.",
