      "item_type": "expectation",
      "source_text": "Notes that Belford does not have any emails to or from teenage hacker Dade Murphy aka Zer0Cool at the email address zer0cool@mindvirus.org.",
      "text_sha256": "7907b97c13b52c957909e3186d94218c599e2a8eec57e95fa18e4be7985ca02d"
    },
    {
